- id: history-depth content: "Decide and document how much history the live export needs. 11 bars suffice for realvol_10d/ret_10d, but the Pine indicator's own 250-bar z-scores require the chart to have loaded enough history, which is exactly what tv_export's 'Go to' navigation guarantees and the current inline download omits" status: pending
